ll},{\"id\":82695,\"title\":\"Les Misérables\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6CuzBs2Lb8At7qQr64mLXg2RYRb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bsG8LkZx1ijrcf3fP6AvBlGTxkX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An adaptation of the successful stage musical based on Victor Hugo's classic novel set in 19th-century France. Jean Valjean, a man imprisoned for stealing bread, must flee a relentless policeman named Javert. The pursuit consumes both men's lives, and soon Valjean finds himself in the midst of the student revolutions in France.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13885,\"title\":\"Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gAW4J1bkRjZKmFsJsIiOBASeoAp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/obYVvi6eD4rjFeC7g4uoZQPIh7F.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The infamous story of Benjamin Barker, a.k.a Sweeney Todd, who sets up a barber shop down in London which is the basis for a sinister partnership with his fellow tenant, Mrs. Lovett. Based on the hit Broadway musical.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":785084,\"title\":\"The Whale\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jQ0gylJMxWSL490sy0RrPj1Lj7e.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/46FRuCeAn6TrS4F1P4F9zhyCpyo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A reclusive English teacher suffering from severe obesity attempts to reconnect with his estranged teenage daughter for one last chance at redemption.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9833,\"title\":\"The Phantom of the Opera\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aTsp2VTaCBiGs8w05OTXfD97FRZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p3P0eTh8AnqauhRZg0wgoBFvcjF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The deformed Phantom who haunts the Paris Opera House causes murder and mayhem in an attempt to make the woman he loves a star.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":600354,\"title\":\"The Father\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pr3bEQ517uMb5loLvjFQi8uLAsp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h3weAFgg06GqchI2xDfufBgSFTj.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A man refuses all assistance from his daughter as he ages and, as he tries to make sense of his changing circumstances, he begins to doubt his loved ones, his own mind and even the fabric of his reality.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":196867,\"title\":\"Annie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aKAM9V0izx4VhsdyAdBvAB26UCZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j3snmrxqxT60FrH1Z8i54fGnHZJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Annie is a young, happy foster kid who's also tough enough to make her way on the streets of New York in 2014. Originally left by her parents as a baby with the promise that they'd be back for her someday, it's been a hard knock life ever since with her mean foster mom Miss Hannigan. But everything's about to change when the hard-nosed tycoon and New York mayoral candidate Will Stacks—advised by his brilliant VP and his shrewd and scheming campaign advisor—makes a thinly-veiled campaign move and takes her in. Stacks believes he's her guardian angel, but Annie's self-assured nature and bright, sun-will-come-out-tomorrow outlook on life just might mean it's the other way around.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1494,\"title\":\"Curse of the Golden Flower\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gHkkDpfo5YnOrbVfwtDHi91BkrU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m3zGXY61pnFZ12gXnJgO0Mg0RWG.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During China's Tang dynasty the emperor has taken the princess of a neighboring province as his wife. She has borne him two sons and raised his eldest. Now his control over his dominion is complete, including the royal family itself.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1574,\"title\":\"Chicago\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3ED8cWCXY9zkx77Sd0N5qMbsdDP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/euxYhuuJjChU755u2YHj0ZPjww3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Murderesses Velma Kelly and Roxie Hart find themselves on death row together and fight for the fame that will keep them from the gallows in 1920s Chicago.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":556574,\"title\":\"Hamilton\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h1B7tW0t399VDjAcWJh8m87469b.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uWVkEo9PWHu9algZsiLPi6sRU64.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Presenting the tale of American founding father Alexander Hamilton, this filmed version of the original Broadway smash hit is the story of America then, told by America now.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1244872,\"title\":\"Nina\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e4Dr3pExlz2qiRdQVpOPtxxzo3B.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hz4Nm8soNLbqoLosFqLy5yUSVUB.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After thirty years, Nina decides to return to the seaside town where she grew up to confront the man who changed her life and to whom the town now pays homage. The reunion with her origins, with her memories and with Blas, a childhood friend, will make her question whether revenge is the only way.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"2lMSVnY-xmg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"